<title>USA: TENNIS-SUNDAY'S FEATURED MATCHES AT U.S. OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SUNDAY'S FEATURED MATCHES AT U.S. OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of Sunday's featured matches at the U.S. Open (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Stadium court, beginning 11:00 a.m. (1500 GMT)</p>
<p>Women's doubles final</p>
<p>1-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic)/Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) v 2-Gigi Fernandez (U.S.)/Natasha Zvereva (Belarus)</p>
<p>Women's singles final (not before 2:00 p.m./1800 gmt)</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) v 2-Monica Seles (U.S.)</p>
<p>Men's singles final (not before 4:00 p.m./2000 gmt)</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v 2-Michael Chang (U.S).</p>
